<title>USA: U.S. mortgage application volume rose in latest wk.</title>
<headline>U.S. mortgage application volume rose in latest wk.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The volume of U.S. mortgage applications rose 18.4 percent in the week ended March 28, according to a Mortgage Bankers Association of America weekly survey.</p>
<p>Specifically, the volume of applications to refinance mortgages increased 22.2 percent in the latest survey week, while applications to purchase mortgages rose 17.3 percent.</p>
<p>The seasonally adjusted refinancing index rose 35.7 percent to 538.4 from 396.7 the previous week.</p>
<p>The purchase index increased 30.5 percent to 257.3 in the latest survey from 197.2 in the previous week.  </p>
